      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It should technically only take a really long time when you first switch to Android, after that it should be petty quick.\n\nAlso, they are changing the default texture format for Android, they can't really do that for only a few select textures. (While yes they can do it on specific textures, that would mean new textures wouldn't use ASTC)",
